        "location": "longterm-mem/internal/promote/legacy.go:115-122",
        "claim": "statusOfObservation matches the other side of a supersedes edge by scanning all[i].SyncID == other with no guard for an empty sync id. The replaced resolveStatus built bySyncID only from observations with a non-empty SyncID, so an empty edge endpoint never resolved. Now an edge with an empty SourceSyncID/TargetSyncID can match any observation with an empty SyncID and a newer CreatedAt, marking a page superseded and linking it to an unrelated successor. Duplicate sync ids also resolve differently: the old map kept the last, the scan takes the first newer one.",
